sted runner.\",\"example\":5,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"image_details\":{\"description\":\"Provides details of a hosted runner image\",\"nullable\":true,\"properties\":{\"display_name\":{\"description\":\"Display name for this image.\",\"example\":20.04,\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"The ID of the image. Use this ID for the `image` parameter when creating a new larger runner.\",\"example\":\"ubuntu-20.04\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"size_gb\":{\"description\":\"Image size in GB.\",\"example\":86,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"source\":{\"description\":\"The image provider.\",\"enum\":[\"github\",\"partner\",\"custom\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"size_gb\",\"display_name\",\"source\"],\"title\":\"GitHub-hosted runner image details.\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"last_active_on\":{\"description\":\"The time at which the runner was last used, in ISO 8601 format.\",\"example\":\"2022-10-09T23:39:01Z\",\"format\":\"date-time\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"machine_size_details\":{\"description\":\"Provides details of a particular machine spec.\",\"properties\":{\"cpu_cores\":{\"description\":\"The number of cores.\",\"example\":8,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"The ID used for the `size` parameter when creating a new runner.\",\"example\":\"8-core\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"memory_gb\":{\"description\":\"The available RAM for the machine spec.\",\"example\":32,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"storage_gb\":{\"description\":\"The available SSD storage for the machine spec.\",\"example\":300,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"cpu_cores\",\"memory_gb\",\"storage_gb\"],\"title\":\"Github-owned VM details.\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"maximum_runners\":{\"default\":10,\"description\":\"The maximum amount of hosted runners. Runners will not scale automatically above this number. Use this setting to limit your cost.\",\"example\":5,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"The name of the hosted runner.\",\"example\":\"my-github-hoste